  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="Tag15" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;8. None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="Tag16" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;9.&amp;#160;&lt;font style="border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15.4px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;Deseret, in the ordinary course of its operations, from time to time becomes subject to various investigations, citations, and actions pending before state and federal regulatory agencies. These matters may include, among others, discussions with the Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) on a number of items, including coal combustion residuals. Given the &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15.4px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;current&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15.4px; line-height: inherit; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;"&gt; stage of these discussions, it is not possible at this time to predict their outcome or to estimate the potential impact, if any, on Deseret's financial condition or results of operations.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock id="Tag17" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;10. None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantChangesRelatedToRespondentCompanyAppearingInAnnualReportToStockholdersTextBlock id="Tag18" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;12. None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantChangesRelatedToRespondentCompanyAppearingInAnnualReportToStockholdersTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="Tag19" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;13. Mark Anderson's term as a Deseret&amp;#160;Trustee ended March 31, 2026. Jeff Peterson will succeed Dave Crabtree as Deseret's&amp;#160;President &amp;amp; CEO effective April 15, 2026.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
